SM-X520 Ubuntu Project
======================

Integration layer (build scripts, initramfs, init, docs, tools/,
device/configs/, manifest.json, kernel/source.json): (c) 2026 project
contributors, MIT (see LICENSE).

Kernel source
-------------
The kernel tree under Kernel/ is assembled from three Samsung open-source
release packages (Android 16, Exynos 1580 platform, GKI 6.6):

  1. SM-X526N_16_Opensource.zip            -> X526NKOU7CZE3_kernel.tar.gz  (base)
  2. SM-X520_16_Opensource_dts.zip         -> X520XXU7CZE3_kernel.tar.gz   (SM-X520 board)
  3. SM-X526N_16_Opensource_X520XXSBCZI2.zip -> X526NKOSBCZI2_kernel.tar.gz (CZI2 update)

Downloaded from the Samsung Open Source Center
(https://opensource.samsung.com, search: X520XXSBCZI2). Licensed under the
GPL-2.0 and Samsung's open-source license terms; see the original package
documentation.

Firmware
--------
Binary firmware blobs (GPU, sensor hub, NPU, video codec) under
Kernel/prebuilts/platform/erd8855/firmware/ are non-free Samsung binaries
from the CZI2 package.

Ubuntu / GNOME
--------------
The userspace is standard Ubuntu 24.04 LTS ARM64 packages from
ports.ubuntu.com, unmodified beyond package selection.
